From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: distinguish Uke charger startup from refused SDP budgets

The USB configuration can precede the remote ADSP charger service. Treat an
unavailable source description as EAGAIN so the existing bounded DWC3 worker
can revalidate it. A known non-SDP source or a request above the reported
source ceiling still fails with EINVAL; no source ceiling is raised here.

Record the final Uke gadget budget result and refused source admission to
separate startup loss from firmware rejection on kernels without tracing.
Exact OEM qti_battery_charger USB property IDs and units are retained from
MiCode uke-v-oss 5712080a4b0c0b1a879e6d145c601c649ddaddfd.

This is a source candidate. Host admission and retry tests are separate from
physical enumeration, input-current readback and sustained battery charging.

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
@@ -1099,8 +1099,17 @@
 			goto out;
 	}
 	/* This first path admits the configured USB2 SDP budget only. */
-	if (!battmgr->usb.online || battmgr->usb.usb_type != POWER_SUPPLY_USB_TYPE_SDP ||
+	if (!battmgr->usb.online ||
+	    battmgr->usb.usb_type == POWER_SUPPLY_USB_TYPE_UNKNOWN ||
+	    !battmgr->usb.current_max) {
+		ret = -EAGAIN;
+		goto out;
+	}
+	if (battmgr->usb.usb_type != POWER_SUPPLY_USB_TYPE_SDP ||
 	    (unsigned int)val->intval > battmgr->usb.current_max) {
+		dev_info(battmgr->dev,
+			 "SDP budget refused: type=%u source=%u request=%d uA\n",
+			 battmgr->usb.usb_type, battmgr->usb.current_max, val->intval);
 		ret = -EINVAL;
 		goto out;
 	}
diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
@@ -2201,6 +2201,9 @@
 	    retries < 50) {
 		WRITE_ONCE(dwc->vbus_draw_retries, retries + 1);
 		schedule_delayed_work(&dwc->vbus_draw_work, msecs_to_jiffies(100));
+	} else if (of_machine_is_compatible("xiaomi,uke")) {
+		dev_info(dwc->dev, "USB budget: request=%u mA result=%d retries=%u\n",
+			 current_limit, ret, retries);
 	}
 
 	if (ret < 0)
